mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">대학생 및 휴학생</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">모집인원</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- 20</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(*</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">선착순 참여 시 조기마감</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">활동내용</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">인성업클 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">미취업청년을 위한 인성역량강화마스터 자격증 과정</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- AImpact change : </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">유익한 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">AI</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">활용 강의와 사회문제 해결을 위한 프로젝트 기획</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- Give&amp;Make : </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">지속가능개발목표</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(SDGs), </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">그리고 기후위기에 대한 교육 및 실천활동</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">약속 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">마약과 그 속에 살고 있는 우리 아이들의 이야기</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">지구여행 굿투어즈 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: INGO </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">직원이 보여주고 들려주는 생생한 국제구호 현장</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\">*5</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;\">개 프로그램 모두 선택 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">접수방법 </span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">네이버폼을 통한 신청서 작성 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: https://naver.me/xZV1tHZt</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">*</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">신청서를 작성해주시면 프로그램별 세부 안내 및 일정조율을 위한 카카오톡이 발송됩니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">혜택내역</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spac